Z||000000||Eric||05-03-2000||02:40 PM||||I just found out some more info on the autox school this Sunday at Delphi.  The registration is from 8:00AM to 10:00AM (I usually show up around 9:00AM).  There is a driver's meeting at 10:30AM and the first car goes out at 11:00AM.  There will be 4 students to every instrutor.  The cost will be $20 to members, but if you sign up for a membership to the SCCA ($55) there I think you get to race for free that day.  I'm not 100% that they'll let non-members race, but if they do, which they probably will, the cost will be $25.  Bring a hemet if you have one and if you don't you can borrow one of their's.||||reg||1
